  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy base Techn support to Iraq 2012-14 - FCO 2012-2014 TSI consultancy base Baghdad Repayment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FCO TSI konsultbas UK ambassad Bagdad 2012-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndig st&#xf6;dinsats f&#xf6;r Technical Support to Iraq (TSI). Sida ing&#xe5;tt &#xf6;verenskommelse med brittiska FCO om villkoren f&#xf6;r att brittiska ambassaden i internationella zonen i Irak skall tillhandah&#xe5;lla kontor, logi, transport och s&#xe4;kerhet f&#xf6;r max 5 internationella konsulter vid ett tillf&#xe4;lle under implementeringen av TSI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a necessary support activity for the project Technical Support to Iraq (TSI). Sida has signed an MoU with British FCO setting out the conditions for the British Embassy in Baghdads International Zone to provide offices, lodging, transport and         security during implementation of TSI for a maximum of 5 international consultants at any one time</narrative>
  </description>
